return {
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【诡变宝箱】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>介绍：</>没有哪位经验丰富的探索者，会轻易相信一份毫无来由的财富。它们有的早已失去主人，有的仍处于守护之下，也有一些只是岁月的痕迹。对于非凡者而言，每一次尝试，都意味着一次选择，这一切的谜题，都等着你来揭晓。用武力和欺骗的手段战胜他们，让他们看看谁才是猎物。\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法指引：</>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. 寻找诡变宝箱</>\n可通过以下任一方式前往玩法：\n<Assistant_Property2>跑团入口：</>打开菜单进入【跑团】，加入任意教团后，在【秩序世界】中选择【诡变宝箱】，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Property1>地图入口：</>打开地图，切换至【探秘】页签，在【世界详情】中查看【诡变宝箱】玩法图标，并根据图标指引，在地图中找到对应标识，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Title3>2. 与宝箱互动</>\n到达目标地点后，与奇怪的宝箱互动，选择开启宝箱，会惊动宝箱周围的敌人。\n<Assistant_Title3>3. 应对选择</>\n被敌人发现后，可选择不同方式应对：\n<Assistant_Red>正面迎战：</>击败敌人即可获得宝箱奖励。\n<Assistant_Red>天赋检定：</>通过对应检定，同样可以获得宝箱奖励；若检定失败，则需进入战斗完成挑战。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Mysterious Treasure Chest】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>No experienced explorer would easily trust wealth that appears out of nowhere. Some have long lost their owners, some remain under guard, and others are merely traces of time. For a Beyonder, every attempt represents a choice, and all these puzzles are waiting for you to solve them. Use force and deception to defeat them and show them who the real prey is.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Guide: </>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. Finding a Mysterious Treasure Chest</>\nYou can navigate to this activity using either of the following methods:\n<Assistant_Property2>TTRPG Entry:</>Open the Menu, enter [TTRPG], join any organization, select [Mysterious Treasure Chest] in the [Orderly World], and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Property1>Map Entry:</>Open the map, switch to the [Exploration] tab, view the [Mysterious Treasure Chest] icon in [World Details], find the corresponding marker on the map based on the icon's guidance, and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Title3>2. Interacting with the Chest</>\nAfter arriving at the target location, interact with the strange treasure chest and choose to open it, which will alert the enemies surrounding it.\n<Assistant_Title3>3. Responding to Choices</>\nOnce discovered by enemies, you can choose different ways to respond:\n<Assistant_Red>Head-on Battle:</>Defeat the enemies to obtain the treasure chest reward.\n<Assistant_Red>Talent Check:</>Pass the corresponding check to also obtain the treasure chest reward; if the check fails, you must enter combat to complete the challenge.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>魔法制服\n某些神秘，藏在星图里，藏在长夜尽头不肯消散的光里。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Magic Uniform \n Some mysteries are hidden in star charts, hidden in the light that refuses to dissipate at the end of the long night.",
    ["<Highlight>{1,2,（烙印已失效）}</>途径专防提高<Mark>300</>。受到攻击有概率触发邂逅，途径专防提高<Mark>180</>，持续<Mark>10</>秒，每<Mark>30</>秒最多触发一次。\n激活套装<Mark>灵与知回响</>时不生效。"] = "<Highlight>{1,2,(Brand Expired)}</>Pathway Special Defense increased by <Mark>300</>. Taking damage has a chance to trigger an Encounter, increasing Pathway Special Defense by <Mark>180</> for <Mark>10</> seconds, with a maximum trigger frequency of once every <Mark>30</> seconds. \nDoes not take effect when the <Mark>Echo of Spirit and Knowledge</> set is active.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>水晶纱绉・辉光点染\n繁花和光辉，邀请你加入一场永不落幕的盛宴。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Crystal Gauze Crepe · Luminous Dotted \n Flowers and radiance invite you to join a feast that never ends.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>精工棉纺・知性花饰・博物学者服\n步履不停，在博物馆中追溯往昔也眺望明日。也许，我们也只是历史孔隙中的剪影。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Precision Cotton・Intellectual Floral Ornament・Naturalist Outfit\nWalking without stopping, tracing the past and looking toward tomorrow in the museum. Perhaps we are just silhouettes in the gaps of history.",
    ["<Highlight>既是猎手，也是猎物</>——你可击杀他人，<Highlight>夺取遗物材料与段位胜点</>。但亦随时可能沦为其它非凡者的攻击目标，<Highlight>建议组队开启狩猎</>！"] = "<Highlight>You are both the hunter and the prey</>—you can kill others to <Highlight>seize relic materials and rank points</>. However, you may also become the target of other Beyonders at any time, <Highlight>so it is recommended to form a team to begin your Hunt</>!",
    ["<P_Heart>脑袋怎么突然有点痛。</>"] = "<P_Heart>Why does my head suddenly hurt a bit?</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（他似乎变得悲伤了，但是还没有要离开天台的意思。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (He seems to have become sad, but he still has no intention of leaving the rooftop.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉默）</>所以你改变了占卜的方式。"] = "<P_Heart> (Silence) </> So you changed the way you perform divination.",
